A||N||59||tellron||1st Florida Swap Meet||||1||
Z||000000||tellron||09-05-2001||09:45 PM||||Suncoast Fiero Swap Meet<BR>Oct. 20 – 21<BR>Ron & Pat Hale’s <BR>12915 Morris Bridge Road<BR>Thonotosassa, FL <P>The first Suncoast Fiero Club swap meet will be held on Sat., Oct 20th from 9am-3pm.  Bring all your excess parts, pieces and yes, whole Fiero’s and be prepared to buy, sell and trade. We currently have 12 to 14 Fieros in various stages of disassembly on site.<P>Saturday will be a day of shopping, pulling parts and thinking about what you need to do to your Fiero for the upcoming March show in Daytona Beach, Florida.  We will be meeting at Tia’s TexMex on Fowler Avenue at 7pm for dinner (Directions will be provided).<P>Sunday morning we will be holding a Pancake Breakfast.  Cost will be $5 with proceeds going to Suncoast Fiero Hospitality Fund to sponsor our refreshment tent in Daytona.<P>At this time we are trying to put together a couple of Tech Sessions for Sunday.  We have arranged a special price of $54.00 per night at a brand new Sleep Inn just 2 miles down the road. The phone number to the hotel is 1-813-988-4048.<P>For more information give Ron or Pat a call at 813-986-6371 after 6:00 p.m. or<BR> e-mail:  tellron@tampabay.rr.com. for more information.<BR>The location of the swap meet is I-4 and I-75 Tampa FL. Email for exact directions.<P>Thanks<BR>Ron Hale 86 SE<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jake_Dragon||09-05-2001||10:00 PM||||Sounds Cool and according to mapquest only 34 minutes from my door.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Finaly some action.||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfixit58||09-06-2001||07:33 AM||||Hey Ron,<P>Sounds GREAT! Count me in! I'll be bringing a whole 87 GT and a bunch of miscellaneous parts. Ya'll bring CASH  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> .<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG"> ||||reg||14
