Z||000025||Cozmo||09-23-2001||06:51 AM||||Here's some pics of stalwart Suncoast Fiero members arranging cars for the swap meet...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/swap3.jpg"> <BR>(That's Dave Connelly, Prez on the far left and Jim Cleary Vice Prez on the far right. Even our officers get in on the grunt work  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> They just ran over the pass. wheelwell liner, causing a loud noise and scaring everybody...)<BR>Here's some of the stuff we have...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/swap1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/swap2.jpg"> <BR>And here's <B>Ron Hale</B> with one of his "projects"<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/swap4.jpg"> <BR>Ron and Pat are really putting a lot of time and effort in this swap meet and it will be really cool.  There is a LOT of stuff already there, with a lot more to be brought out on the day of the meet.<BR>This should be a good one, attend if you can!<P>BobC||||reg||1
