Z||000036||mrfixit58||10-20-2001||05:30 PM||||Just got home from the 1st Annual (hopefully) Florida Swap Meet. What a great time. Ron and Pat are great hosts. We had a good turnout with good representation from three other clubs. Aside from lots of Fiero parts, Cozmo was there with an EXTENSIVE fiero toy collection... he sold a TON of stuff and still had a lot to take home. And folks, get this, also in attendance was Mr. Mike (I'm gonna get me some seats), Helms Motor Sports (rear coil overs, you bet), and Ed Parks (The 4.9 Caddy conversion is on the way). <P>Alex4mula came up from West Palm Beach area and we did some swapping.. (Alex, I'll get the arrows to you this week  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ). Stand up guy if anyone has reason to do business.<P>Well, for all those who couldn't make it this year, I hope we get another chance to meet next year. <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000037||Jake_Dragon||10-20-2001||06:51 PM||||Had a great time, bought some used carpet and mats from Mr.Mike <B>Now</B> my wife understand why I want his seats  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.<BR>SEADOG helped me grab a door handle.<BR>Cozmo sold me some MR2 vents don't know what I will do with them yet but I will come up with something. Grabbed a passenger seat for the coupe. Pulled the old one right there and stuck in the new one, has speakers and everything. Found a center console for the GT that will hold me over till I make my own.<P>Tellron we had a great time hope to see you all again. Hey Tellron I bought my seat and console from the gentleman that had the 4 Fieros to the left I would like to thank him as well but I am terrible with names.<BR>You guys still open tomorrow?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000038||CoolBlue87GT||10-20-2001||07:31 PM||||Dave here, Pic's to follow. It was a great day. Was glad to meet old / new friends.<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Ron1.jpg">      <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Ron5.jpg">    <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Ron6.jpg">  <BR>This site will give you all the photo's <A HREF="http://www.ofoto.com/UploadConfirm.jsp?&UV=94579698584_62422493203&US=0" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ofoto.com/UploadConfirm.jsp?&UV=94579698584_62422493203&US=0</A> <P>(Let me know if one of these paths does not work)<BR> <A HREF="http://www.ofoto.com/BrowsePhotos.jsp?UV=572515384353_49687914203&US=0&collid=47143493203" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ofoto.com/BrowsePhotos.jsp?UV=572515384353_49687914203&US=0&collid=47143493203</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 10-23-2001).]||||reg||6
