Z||000045||fldevel||10-21-2001||04:33 PM||||hey !! if you guys would have stayed for just a few more hours ya could have meet MEE !! lol all well it was nice talking to ya ron and your famly it was worth the trip down there to meet ya ..maybe ill show up on time next time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> heh heh ||||reg||1
Z||000046||tellron||10-21-2001||05:40 PM||||Thanks to everybody who attended our 1st ever Florida Fiero Swap Meet. We all had a great time. This is why we work so hard at Fiero functions, to watch Fiero people having fun with Fiero people! We had over 50 people show up, some to sell, some to buy, and some to just have a great time! I think we accomplished that!! Thank you to Dave Held with Held Motor Sports, Mr. Mike with his ever famous Leather Seat Covers, Ed Parks from The Fiero Factory, and to all the others who brought stuff to sell!  We had good representation from Fiero Clubs as well. SpaceCoast Fieros, Central Florida Fieros, West Palm Beach Fieros, Daytona Fieros, Alabama Fieros, and Suncoast Fieros!! 17 Fieros in the front yard with the Suncoast banner hanging up almost caused 2 accidents from people looking at all the Fieros in one place. I thought we were going to have to have a traffic cop directing traffic past the house! Thanks again to everyone and we look forward to the next Fiero event where ever that might be!||||reg||6
Z||000047||tellron||10-21-2001||05:40 PM||||Thanks to everybody who attended our 1st ever Florida Fiero Swap Meet. We all had a great time. This is why we work so hard at Fiero functions, to watch Fiero people having fun with Fiero people! We had over 50 people show up, some to sell, some to buy, and some to just have a great time! I think we accomplished that!! Thank you to Dave Held with Held Motor Sports, Mr. Mike with his ever famous Leather Seat Covers, Ed Parks from The Fiero Factory, and to all the others who brought stuff to sell!  We had good representation from Fiero Clubs as well. SpaceCoast Fieros, Central Florida Fieros, West Palm Beach Fieros, Daytona Fieros, Alabama Fieros, and Suncoast Fieros!! 17 Fieros in the front yard with the Suncoast banner hanging up almost caused 2 accidents from people looking at all the Fieros in one place. I thought we were going to have to have a traffic cop directing traffic past the house! Thanks again to everyone and we look forward to the next Fiero event where ever that might be!||||reg||6
