Z||000050||Alex4mula||10-22-2001||11:21 AM||||Yeah, it was very nice to meet people face to face. Fiero people are great  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> I bought perfect engine grills for $1 each! Plus all the nice parts I swaped with Roy. Thanks for that. Also thanks Ron for being an awesome host and providing us his facilities  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> This should become a yearly event.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    Alex4mula<BR>:) Red-Original Owner & White-1/94 with PM (:||||reg||1
